{
    "title": "Cars Quiz 3D",
    "description": "If you love all things cars or enjoy playing quizzes, then this game is for you!\r\nYou can play Cars Quiz: What's the Car absolutely free of charge.\r\nYou\u2019ll see a some car in 3d and you need to name its brand or model.\r\nThere are many cars brands and models in the game.\r\nAt each play you\u2018ll need guess one brand or model car by 3d-like photo.\r\nOne level contains 8 cars. \r\nThere is 2 quiz mode.\r\n1st mode  \u2022 Entering full words manualy.\r\n2nd mode  \u2022 It's classic quiz and you need choose 1 correct answer from 6 options. You can to switch by the special hints button to this mode.\r\n\r\nThere are many levels in this game and we regularly add new levels.\r\nWe\u2019ll be issuing new cars in game 'Cars Quiz: What's the car?' soon\u2014be sure not to miss that! \r\n\r\nAlso you can rate this app to 5 stars and write in comments what the car model you want to see in this game in next versions.\r\n\r\nThank you for choosing our game!\r\n\r\nDisclaimer\r\nAll car and cars logos shown in this game are protected by copyright and/or registered trademarks.\r\nThis app, not anyone associated with it, claims any ownership (copyright or otherwise) of any cars and cars logos used in this app. The use of low-resolution images in this application for the use of logos and cars models identifying qualifies as \"fair use\u201d under copyright law. We are not connected or affiliated with the brands/clubs. Any content will be removed if asked by the legal owners.",
